---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Certificates from '../components/Certificates.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<Layout description="Hi! I'm Philip. Welcome to my website!">
    <Hero/>
    <!-- <hr/> -->
    <div class="content">
	<div class="left">
	    <h2>Skills</h2>

			<hr>
		<p>
				I have strong expertise in web development (<span class="tag">HTML</span>, <span class="tag">CSS</span>, <span class="tag">Javascript</span> and <span class="tag">Typescript</span>), as well as <span class="tag">Python</span> and <span class="tag">C++</span>.</br>
				I'm experienced with databases like <span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span>, <span class="tag">MongoDB</span>
				And I've worked extensively with <span class="tag">Docker</span> for streamlined, scalable deployments.
				My deep understanding of the <span class="tag">Linux</span> operating system comes from daily usage and development tasks.
				My passion <span class="tag">&#9829;</span> lies in back-end development, though I also enjoy front-end work.
			</p>
			</br>
            <h2>Background</h2>
			<hr>
		<p>
			From an early age, I've been fascinated in the <span class="tag">magics</span> of computing.
			I wanted to figure out what made them <span class="tag">tick</span>.
			What could you make them do? Anything?</br>
				I was drawn to these questions like a <span class="tag">magnet</span>, spending endless hours learning about and writing different software.</br>
			When starting high school, I enrolled in a technology-focused school, choosing a program with an emphasis on programming (<a href="https://ntigymnasiet.se/program/teknikprogrammet/informations-och-medieteknik/">Information and media technology</a>).
			While there, I deepened my understanding of the topic, reinforcing what I have already learnt in a more professional and academic environment.
		</p>
        </div>
        <aside>
            <Certificates />
        </aside>
    </div>
</Layout>
<style>

    .tag {
	    color: var(--accent);
	    font-style: italic;
    }

    .content {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        grid-template-rows: 1fr;
        grid-column-gap: 2em;
    }

    .content > * {
        
    }

    .content > div {
        grid-area: 1 / 1 / 2 / 4;
        padding: 0em 1em 1em 1em;
        /* background-color: var(--secondary-opacity);
        border: 1px solid var(--primary-opacity); */

    }

    .content .left {
	    display: flex;
	    flex-direction: column;
	    gap: 1em;
    }

    .content aside {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1em;
        grid-area: 1 / 4 / 2 / 5;
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 1000px) {
        .content {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2em;
	}
	.left {
	    padding: 0;
        }
    }
</style>
